T* (_ Nicolo Machiavelli, born at Florence on 3rd May 1469. From 1494 to) Tj
T* (1512 held an official post at Florence which included diplomatic) Tj
T* (missions to various European courts. Imprisoned in Florence, 1512;) Tj
